*% The following entries provide information about specific paper keywords.
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "11.34 11.34 583.66 830.66 "
*ImageableArea A5: "11.34 11.34 408.66 583.66 "
*ImageableArea B5: "11.34 11.34 504.66 717.66 "
*ImageableArea BRPostcard/Card: "11.34 11.34 271.66 408.66 "
*ImageableArea Letter: "11.34 11.34 600.66 780.66 "
*ImageableArea Legal: "11.34 11.34 600.66 996.66 "
*ImageableArea Env10/Com-10: "11.34 11.34 285.66 672.66 "
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch/Monarch: "11.34 11.34 267.66 528.66 "
*ImageableArea EnvC5/C5: "11.34 11.34 447.66 637.66 "
*ImageableArea EnvDL/DL: "11.34 11.34 300.66 612.66 "
*ImageableArea Executive: "11.34 11.34 510.66 744.66 "

*?ImageableArea: "
 save
   /cvp { (                ) cvs print ( ) print } bind def
   /upperright {10000 mul floor 10000 div} bind def
   /lowerleft {10000 mul ceiling 10000 div} bind def
   newpath clippath pathbbox
   4 -2 roll exch 2 {lowerleft cvp} repeat
   exch 2 {upperright cvp} repeat
   (\n) print flush
 restore
"
*End

