*% Custom Page Sizes ===================
*% min: 255 pts x 396 pts   (3.54 inch * 5.50 inch) 
*% max: 612 pts x 2551 pts  (8.50 inch * 35.43 inch)
*MaxMediaWidth: "612"
*MaxMediaHeight: "2551"
*HWMargins: 14 10 14 10
*ParamCustomPageSize Width:  1 points 255 612
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 396 2551
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0

*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 1

*CustomPageSize True: "
    2 dict begin
    pop pop pop
    2 array astore /PageSize exch def
    /ImagingBBox null def
    currentdict end setpagedevice"
*End

*OpenGroup: PQ_Color/Controls print quality and color settings.
*% ColorMode Information ===============
*%BRFlags *BRColorMode
*OpenUI *BRColorMode/Output Color: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11.0 AnySetup *BRColorMode
*DefaultBRColorMode: Color
*BRColorMode Color/Color: "
    1 dict dup /ProcessColorModel /DeviceCMYK put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRColorMode Black/Black/White: "
    1 dict dup /ProcessColorModel /DeviceGray put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRColorMode: "
    save
    currentpagedevice /ProcessColorModel get
    /DeviceGray eq {(Black)}{(Color)}ifelse
    = flush
    restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *BRColorMode

*OpenUI *BRHalftone/Document Types: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20.0 AnySetup *BRHalftone
*DefaultBRHalftone: Normal
*BRHalftone Normal/Normal: "
    1 dict dup /MaxSuperScreen 0 put setuserparams
    1 dict dup /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 1 dict dup
    /EngineScreen 0 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRHalftone SuperFine/Super Fine: "
    1 dict dup /MaxSuperScreen 0 put setuserparams
    1 dict dup /HWResolution [1200 1200] put setpagedevice
    1 dict dup /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 1 dict dup
    /EngineScreen 1 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRHalftone Transparencies/Transparencies: "
    1 dict dup /MaxSuperScreen 0 put setuserparams
    1 dict dup /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 1 dict dup
    /EngineScreen 2 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRHalftone Photo/Photo: "
    1 dict dup /MaxSuperScreen 0 put setuserparams
    1 dict dup /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 1 dict dup
    /EngineScreen 3 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRHalftone HG/Normal(High Gloss): "
    1 dict dup /MaxSuperScreen 0 put setuserparams
    1 dict dup /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails 1 dict dup
    /EngineScreen 4 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRHalftone: "
  save
    [(Normal)(SuperFine)(Transparencies)(Photo)(HG)]
    currentpagedevice
    /PostRenderingEnhanceDetails get /EngineScreen get
    get = flush
  restore
"
*End

*CloseUI: *BRHalftone

*% RGB Gamma Correction Information ===============
*OpenUI *BRRGBBCorrection/Gamma Correction: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 130.0 AnySetup *BRRGBBCorrection
*DefaultBRRGBBCorrection: Dark
*BRRGBBCorrection Lightest/1.0: "
/DefaultRGB_Gamma1.0 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultRGB_Gamma1.0 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultRGB exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
/DefaultGray_Gamma1.0 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultGray_Gamma1.0 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultGray exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
"
*End
*BRRGBBCorrection Light/1.4: "
/DefaultRGB_Gamma1.4 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultRGB_Gamma1.4 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultRGB exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
/DefaultGray_Gamma1.4 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultGray_Gamma1.4 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultGray exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
"
*End
*BRRGBBCorrection Standard/1.8: "
/DefaultRGB_Gamma1.8 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultRGB_Gamma1.8 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultRGB exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
/DefaultGray_Gamma1.8 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultGray_Gamma1.8 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultGray exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
"
*End
*BRRGBBCorrection Dark/2.2: "
/DefaultRGB_Gamma2.2 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultRGB_Gamma2.2 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultRGB exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
/DefaultGray_Gamma2.2 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultGray_Gamma2.2 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultGray exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
"
*End
*BRRGBBCorrection Darkest/2.6: "
/DefaultRGB_Gamma2.6 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultRGB_Gamma2.6 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultRGB exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
/DefaultGray_Gamma2.6 /ColorSpace resourcestatus {
    pop pop /DefaultGray_Gamma2.6 /ColorSpace findresource 
    /DefaultGray exch /ColorSpace defineresource pop
} if
"
*End
*BRRGBBCorrection Off/Off: ""
*?BRRGBBCorrection: "
save
    currentpagedevice /UseCIEColor get false eq {
        (Off)
    }{
        /DefaultRGB /ColorSpace findresource
        dup length 2 eq {
            1 get dup /TargetGamma known {
                /TargetGamma get dup 1.0 eq {
                    pop (Lightest)
                }{
                    dup 1.4 eq {
                        pop (Light)
                    }{
                        dup 1.8 eq {
                            pop (Standard)
                        }{
                            dup 2.2 eq {
                                pop (Dark)
                            }{
                                2.6 eq {
                                    (Darkest)
                                }{
                                    (Unknown)
                                } ifelse
                            } ifelse
                        } ifelse
                    } ifelse
                } ifelse
            }{
                pop (Unknown)
            } ifelse
        }{
            pop (Unknown)
        } ifelse
    } ifelse
    = flush
restore
"
*End
 
*CloseUI: *BRRGBBCorrection

