*OpenGroup: AdvancedMedia/Controls paper selection and tray settings.
*% ===== MediaType =========================================
*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper Type:  PickOne
*OrderDependency: 90.0 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain1
*MediaType Plain1/Plain Paper (64-105g/m2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (plain1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Transparency/Transparency: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (transparency) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy1/Thick Paper 1 (106-162g/m2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (heavy1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy3/Thick Paper 2 (163-216g/m2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (heavy3) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy4/Thick Paper 2 (Side 2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (heavy4) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Gloss1/Glossy Paper: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (gloss1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Gloss2/Glossy Paper (Side 2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (gloss2) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Label/Label: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (label) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Postcard1/Card: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (postcard1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Postcard2/Card (Side 2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (postcard2) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Envelope1/Envelope: "1 dict dup /MediaClass (envelope1) put setpagedevice"
*MediaType Envelope2/Envelope (Side 2): "1 dict dup /MediaClass (envelope2) put setpagedevice"
*?MediaType: "
save
    currentpagedevice /MediaClass get dup null eq {pop (Plain1)}
     { dup (transparency) eq {pop (Transparency)}
      { dup (heavy1) eq {pop (Heavy1)}
       {dup (heavy3) eq{pop (Heavy3)}
        {dup (heavy4) eq {pop (Heavy4)}
         {dup (gloss1) eq {pop (Gloss1)}
          {dup (gloss2) eq {pop (Gloss2)}
           {dup (label) eq {pop (Label)}
            {dup (postcard1) eq {pop (Postcard1)}
             {dup (postcard2) eq {pop (Postcard2)}
              {dup (envelope1) eq {pop (Envelope1)}
               {dup (envelope2) eq {pop (Envelope2)}
                {(Unknown)} ifelse
               } ifelse 
              } ifelse 
             } ifelse 
            } ifelse 
           } ifelse 
          } ifelse
         } ifelse
        } ifelse
       } ifelse
      } ifelse
     } ifelse
   = flush
restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *BRPrintDirection/Paper Orientation on MP Tray : PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *BRPrintDirection
*DefaultBRPrintDirection: UseDefault
*BRPrintDirection UseDefault/Use Default: ""
*BRPrintDirection SEF/Portrait: "
    1 dict dup /LeadingEdge 0 put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRPrintDirection SEF2/Portrait(Rotate): "
    1 dict dup /LeadingEdge 2 put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRPrintDirection: "
  save
    currentpagedevice /LeadingEdge get dup null eq
    {pop (SEF)}
    {[(SEF)(Unknown)(SEF2)(Unknown)] exch get} ifelse = flush
  restore
 "
*End
*CloseUI: *BRPrintDirection

*OpenUI *BRCollate/Collate: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15.0 AnySetup *BRCollate 
*DefaultBRCollate: False
*BRCollate False/Off: "
        1  dict dup /Collate false put setpagedevice"
*End
*BRCollate True/On: "
        1  dict dup /Collate true put setpagedevice"
*End
*?BRCollate: "
  save
    currentpagedevice /Collate get
    {(True)} {(False)} ifelse
    = flush
  restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *BRCollate

*% SlipSheet Information ===================
*OpenUI *BRSlipSheet/Transparency Dividers:  PickOne
*OrderDependency: 80.0 AnySetup *BRSlipSheet
*DefaultBRSlipSheet: NoSlip
*BRSlipSheet NoSlip/Off: "1 dict dup /SlipSheet 0 put setpagedevice"
*BRSlipSheet GoSlipWhite/Insert Plain Paper: "
  1 dict dup /SlipSheet 4 put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRSlipSheet GoSlipCopy/Insert Printed Paper: "
  /FXProcs /ProcSet resourcestatus {
    /FXProcs /ProcSet findresource /slipcopy get exec
  } if pop pop
  1 dict dup /SlipSheet 4 put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRSlipSheet: "
  save
    currentpagedevice /SlipSheet get 4 eq
    {(GoSlipWhite)}{(NoSlip)}ifelse = flush
  restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *BRSlipSheet

*OpenUI *BRSlipSource/Feed Dividers from: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 80.0 AnySetup *BRSlipSource
*DefaultBRSlipSource: Auto
*BRSlipSource Auto/Auto: "
    1 dict dup /SlipSheetDetails 1 dict dup /AutoTraySelect 1 put
    put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRSlipSource Tray1/Tray1:  "
    1 dict dup /SlipSheetDetails 2 dict dup dup /AutoTraySelect 0 put
    /SheetTray 0 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRSlipSource Tray2/Tray2:  "
    1 dict dup /SlipSheetDetails 2 dict dup dup /AutoTraySelect 0 put
    /SheetTray 1 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRSlipSource Tray3/Tray3:  "
    1 dict dup /SlipSheetDetails 2 dict dup dup /AutoTraySelect 0 put
    /SheetTray 2 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRSlipSource: "
"
*End
*CloseUI: *BRSlipSource

*OpenUI *BRUnsupportedSizePolicy/No Tray with specified size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20.0 AnySetup *BRUnsupportedSizePolicy
*DefaultBRUnsupportedSizePolicy: UseDefault
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy UseDefault/Use Default: ""
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy3/Nearest size (Adjust image): "
    1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 3 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy5/Nearest size (Do Not Adjust image): "
    1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 5 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy4/Next larger size (Adjust image): "
    1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 4 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy6/Next larger size (Do Not Adjust image): "
    1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 6 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*BRUnsupportedSizePolicy Policy2/Interact with operator: "
    1 dict dup /Policies 1 dict dup /PageSize 2 put put setpagedevice
"
*End
*?BRUnsupportedSizePolicy: "
  save
  [(Unknown)(Unknown)(Policy2)(Policy3)(Policy4)(Policy5)(Policy6)(Unknown)]
  currentpagedevice /Policies get /PageSize get get = flush
  restore
"
*End
*CloseUI: *BRUnsupportedSizePolicy

*CloseGroup: AdvancedMedia

